{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Records that a human looked at each immutable-or-tag pin this repository",
    "runs on, what it actually is, and when. An immutable commit SHA proves a",
    "reference cannot move; it says nothing about whether anyone has ever read",
    "what that commit contains, so this file is the review record orbit's audit",
    "(tomlawesome/orbit#508) recommended every repository keep alongside its",
    "pins. Adopted per #711 -- shape copied from orbit's",
    ".github/supply-chain-policy.json, contents rebuilt for mikroview's own",
    "pins rather than copied.",
    "",
    "Two kinds of pin live here, because that is what mikroview actually has:",
    "ciActions (GitHub Actions `uses:` lines, pinned to a 40-character commit",
    "SHA) and containerImages (the `FROM`/`image:` lines in the Dockerfile and",
    ".gitlab-ci.yml, pinned only to a tag -- mikroview does not pin these to a",
    "digest today, and adding that is out of scope here; this file records what",
    "is actually pinned, not what a stricter policy would prefer).",
    "",
    "'shipped: true' marks an image that ends up in the artefact mikroview",
    "distributes (the Dockerfile's runtime stage). Every other entry is",
    "build- or CI-only tooling: mikroview never redistributes it, so a",
    "copyleft licence on a scanner or bot (semgrep, renovate) carries no",
    "distribution obligation the way a shipped dependency's would.",
    "",
    "Checked by tools/supply-chain/pins-policy.mjs, run by hand",
    "(`node tools/supply-chain/pins-policy.mjs`) pending a CI job -- wiring it",
    "into .gitlab-ci.yml is separate work this pass did not touch."
  ],
